  "comment": "The engine files the extension ships in its pdf/ folder. Read by fonts.ts (the worker's font fallback) and by apps/extension/scripts/copy-engine-assets.mjs, which copies each `from` (a path inside the installed `package`) to apps/extension/public/pdf/<file>.",
